## Figma 令牌工作流

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["Figma Variables"] --> B["Tokens Studio 插件"]
    B --> C["tokens.json (Git)"]
    C --> D["Style Dictionary"]
    D --> E["CSS / JS / iOS"]
    D --> F["Tailwind Config"]
```

### Figma Variables 映射

| Figma 概念          | 令牌概念               |
| ------------------- | ---------------------- |
| Color Variable      | 颜色令牌               |
| Number Variable     | 间距/尺寸令牌          |
| Variable Mode       | 主题变体（light/dark） |
| Variable Collection | 令牌集合               |

